### 5. \uc0\u55357 \u56568  Evidence Collection Features\
\
**Location:** Evidence Tab\
\
**Available Evidence Types:**\
1. **Photo Evidence**\
   - Camera capture or photo library\
   - Automatic metadata (date, time, location)\
